, "table", "tennis", "hud", "bibchik"], "long_description": "Bibchik's Eleven HUD provides real-time opponent intelligence while playing Eleven Table Tennis.\n\nFeatures:\n\u2022 See opponent ELO, match count, and friendly rating before the match starts\n\u2022 Head-to-head record and win percentage history\n\u2022 Opponent paddle settings including rubber type, bounce, friction, and throw values\n\nPremium features ($0.99/month):\n\u2022 Detailed paddle intel with lab calibration data\n\u2022 Head-to-head statistics", "short_description": "Real-time opponent intel overlay for Eleven Table Tennis"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://champadev.com/eleven-hud/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ChampaDev", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://champadev.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_CN", "fr", "de", "ja", "ko", "pt_BR", "ru", "es"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "TRACKED_KEYBOARD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25740641082278425"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1306243148200659"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1306243148200659"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1779972420, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1306243148200659"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26152462314429631", "version": "1.2.15"}, "id": "1460174155743660", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25590607680615100", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26152462314429631"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1460174155743660"}]}, "change_log": "Short introduction of all new features added and improved since initial release in Meta Store:\n1. Performance improvements - less resources utilization in general and no battery drain when your VR headset is in sleep mode with Eleven HUD not closed manually.\n2. Main Menu features:\n- Leaderboard with filters, each player row is clickable to show a player details.\n- more data in Portals and Community pages\n- Tips & Recommendation page has translations to all main languages\n- Paddle Lab page now has better descriptions and visual animations of main rubber settings + Calibration guide. All based on best community players experience and recommendations.\n- Ball Machine page allows to manage your own ball machine presets easy to download, upload, merge, etc.. A user has to have verified account registered in website 11tt.top in order to have this feature fully functional.\nAlso when you upload any ball machine preset to your player collection from other app pages - it's automatically stored here additionally.\n3. As main data is cached on server side there may be a need to get fresh data for your case - now all main pages have refresh buttons that force backend server to process and shown fresh data for you.\n4. Direct links to main 11TT portals are shown on player profiles - click and see the player data on any popular portal.\n5. Settings tab:\n- Match Detection parameter - as main app pages are supposed to be used only between matches and only Opponent Monitor screen has significant optimizations for working with not affecting FPS of the game while being in multitasking mode - this setting parameter allows to automatically open this screen if user forgot to do it - protects your FPS during playing matches.\n- Chat Notification section allows to configure incoming messages notification behavior\n6. Messages tab. Had many issues, majority is fixed and should work smooth from now.\n7. Detective tab:\n- refresh button for getting non-cached results + direct links to community portals.\n- shows short information for parent account. Should also detect information related to detecting \"child\" accounts, has some issues now, will be fixed soon.\n8. Spy Analysis inside Detective tab. Ball Machine Presets from past matches - Allows to upload to the game and to your ball machine collection specific hits and serves from matches database of 11tt.top portal.", "created_date": 1779991004, "id": "26152462314429631", "version": "1.2.15", "version_code": 4030, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25590607680615100", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26152462314429631"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1460174155743660"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1779990875, "id": "26152440894431773", "version": "1.2.13", "version_code": 2027, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename"